    "title": "Portfolio rate and premium impact",
    "explanation": "The available exposure-weighted rate change is {{rate_change}}, while the fixed-exposure premium impact is {{premium_impact}}. These measures differ because one averages rate changes and the other measures premium impact. The portfolio reconciliation returned no deterministic findings.",
    "recommended_action": "Review the exposure and premium weighting assumptions and validate the rating changes underlying the larger segment movements.",
    "evidence_refs": [
      "metric:exposure_weighted",
