      "related_deterministic_finding_ids": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Largest reported segment movements",
      "explanation": "The largest absolute reported rate movements are in H01-S09 and H01-S04, each with a reported rate change of {{segment_rate_change}}. Other leading movements are smaller. These are rate movements, not segment premium-impact estimates; no discrepancies were reported.",
      "recommended_action": "Investigate the rating-factor inputs and business rationale for the comparatively larger movements, and assess their contribution to premium impact using segment-level exposure or premium weights.",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "calc:H01-S09",
